#: ../source/python/plot.rst:198
msgid "Using the extracted data"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/python/plot.rst:200
msgid ""
"The functions ``gfp.slice_field`` and ``gfp.slice_mesh`` only extract the "
"data and return a ``SliceData`` object, with the attributes ``points`` (n x "
"3 array), ``simplexes`` (dictionary dimension -> array of point indices), "
"``values`` (n or n x q array), ``edges`` and ``name``. It can be used with "
"any other plotting tool, and ``gfp.to_pyvista(data)`` converts it to a "
"``pyvista.UnstructuredGrid``."
msgstr ""
